//
// LFM2-1.2B Q4_0 prefill compile-only smoke test: builds the 7 prefill ELFs
// both block types need (rms_qkv_qknorm_rope + flash_attn + o_ffn, plus the
// ShortConv leaves rms_op / in_proj / gate_mul / conv1d) through the
// AIR -> AIE -> aiecc -> Peano pipeline. No NPU dispatch and no weight data
// (weights are runtime BOs), so this is the signal CI can always give without
// the external checkpoint. Pairs with run_npu2_verify.lit (end-to-end top-k
// correctness, gated on the weight data).
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_compile
// RUN: cd test_peano_compile
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: Compilation passed.
